                          <h4 className="text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 flex items-center">
                            <svg className="w-5 h-5 text-[#D2A02A] mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path strokeLinecap="round" strokeLinejoin="round" strokeWidth="2" d="M3 12l2-2m0 0l7-7 7 7M5 10v10a1 1 0 001 1h3m10-11l2 2m-2-2v10a1 1 0 01-1 1h-3m-6 0a1 1 0 001-1v-4a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v4a1 1 0 001 1m-6 0h6"></path></svg>
                            Strategic Legal Intervention
                          </h4>
